{"job_id":"F-dbc66368b29b018d2c97","family_id":"F-dbc66368b29b018d2c97","title":"정부보관금에 관한 법률","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":12,"target_id":"baa158218931733cb61db288699035fefecf4a85a57af7ff36036ef3ef41f4d6","source_hash":"b760839bf38a46c609f3a12072ab13322c4676b8e1550ede88d6fa45d846791b","text":"政府存款法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":420,"target_id":"1b1e06de7249c0fe2ef72d41e272141ddc4414bdbc4f63685f2bf860a892f403","source_hash":"8bd69c284c5806f0f13780ee0059712f280ba669e62bf954cdcc01b1fb2c367a","text":"第一条（归还国库）\n① 政府依法依规持有的公私资金（以下简称“持有资金”），除法律另有规定外，自下列各款所列分类之日起十年后，如无人提出退还申请，应当归还国库。<2020年3月31日修订>\n1. 具有固定释放期限的存款，用于履行存储义务：存储义务解除后的第二天\n2. 无固定到期日资金的托管义务解除：托管次日\n3. 因诉讼而无法申请退款的押金：判决生效后的第二天\n② 各中央机关负责人应当在第1款规定的时效期限届满前，按照财政经济部条例的规定，提前通知有权申请退还相关押金的人员，告知其有权申请退还押金。<2020年3月31日新增；2025年10月1日更新>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":420,"end":474,"target_id":"f0bb761a640d9fe64b12320633bdf97b3396ccc2e37e1e63c99b2d16ff886689","source_hash":"d505eaafac849600fdff139e0056d79922b89142695b2ebbf90f2acde3f470d3","text":"第二条（利息）除法律或合同另有规定外，存款不计利息。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":474,"end":527,"target_id":"66c083ef541975c3b81729a60724ceb45079ecbb2d59226aae2f48ae208c8bfe","source_hash":"9175d08df548bce2c933e387e2508d418fad5970b570a950fa2492155ab1248a","text":"第三条（禁止出售等）存款凭证不得出售、转让或用作质押的抵押品。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":527,"end":571,"target_id":"78ac8981e1f0d47436cdae252c2486443dfcea9257043c4adbd648f8003bc58d","source_hash":"f1d8578fdab84f31df0dfbaad2c17181a998a66764cf7974a994041f550d81d6","text":"第四条（免税）存款收据或转账证明不得加盖印花。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":571,"end":648,"target_id":"016404884d93ed6b1d4a865e02a377a295e3c9bd5888f8ea09b8ba14abc00de1","source_hash":"c846df6f61c6eb171dda3ccf4505673e0af002b305c29975940eff8a184618bc","text":"第 4 条之 2（适用规定）《国库资金管理法》第 35 条、第 37 条、第 38 条、第 40 条、第 45 条和第 46 条的规定，比照适用于存款资金的拨付和保管。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":648,"end":669,"target_id":"f63885fa0ac6b06fcef16d4400e5db8975330c4d7dc408d131ee0b464bb64d78","source_hash":"9983caf06ab0712ea4520f57f5ea5de90b9a82d21b17bb323bddd8e769f35a11","text":"文章 5 已删除 <2009.12.29>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":669,"end":749,"target_id":"ef6423db8a4798e42da5d0c0b2bd47ec886b848dbe9b8a86dfc9a01af5431649","source_hash":"726bed67aed5e00d724d64d38f60efc9e06d417c4f0ccd4ace1d5e434592757c","text":"附录 <第 839 号，1961 年 12 月 13 日>\n\n①本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n② 兹废止朝鲜檀基年间（公元4244年）《存款条例》的实施。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":749,"end":834,"target_id":"3198bf8d3b83fa2d6afaa37f1859ed0648efec15a4c597d8644e3cb3c917a28e","source_hash":"30bd045b780ee749c8bd4e76ed0057c436e68002ac5c7c7647a54f11069d98d9","text":"补充规定（关于因政府部门名称等变更而修订建筑法等的法案）<1997年12月13日第5454号法案>\n\n本法自1998年1月1日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":834,"end":866,"target_id":"bdb9cbb0267d38073620f3e49e9d814a36c3f7d006b4092dce8b8507bc7c4c5f","source_hash":"34bc3ff52651b7e51cf40e61cc2da35ff63d50f0e037ed38e174f4586fd2279b","text":"附录（财政资金管理法）<法案编号 6836，2002 年 12 月 30 日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":866,"end":902,"target_id":"c9397f1a80bbbce3f63934a9440514c76abbf20dce21b0ae0c2d28eaa707e32a","source_hash":"b6886e000559b033e43012e93ae91d908787159d53f4ee71413499c69560e10b","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自2003年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":902,"end":917,"target_id":"6023c4a8527982f0df6b650ecd10a6c81f07f61a9603786eba753c5f365e4606","source_hash":"5b9afbdf2e8854c1395bfd4c406e8831273cb316d6a621d74a00d09486bb51ae","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":917,"end":995,"target_id":"1778532e11958de5d0a744df2c14f966587324368d3f4da9efc756ed6ee670de","source_hash":"02a26c3f5c14e1d25f71d78af61dae53188accecc7d0b2d7d331ed6ab01f5179","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①和② 已省略\n\n  ③ 《政府存款法》修改如下。\n\n  新增第4-2条如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":995,"end":1097,"target_id":"d985ffa66c92b60ad2ea31e9642e4acbe04b82507693c43e684908d8aa14a831","source_hash":"779ee3203873977f34145eeb5f755118750b6d17d50c6d68f45aa3ea18e008fd","text":"  第 4 条之 2（适用规定）《国库管理法》第 35 条、第 37 条、第 38 条、第 40 条、第 45 条和第 46 条的规定，比照适用于保管资金的支付和保管。\n\n  ④ 至 <31> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1097,"end":1105,"target_id":"3ca77ff41c378d07c18e39b4896bec0a09da6b51d3432e93d9ce6f753f4808d3","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1105,"end":1149,"target_id":"273db408675637672ca40a51079753cc1aebd25071ce479275938eac56006745","source_hash":"5935558523ae138dc2b804a8017b7182eb77fe696a13ae5646a29d5f08ecb2f8","text":"补充规定 <第9826号，2009年12月29日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1149,"end":1173,"target_id":"73fc9a9b9985395ae605d49df2a7a5390efbc93e62731af4a3fc10686a5f4e24","source_hash":"a61f20597c21d4e9b1d35585b33eae8378ffb52c23d1d12117aaeae1092a643f","text":"补充规定 <第17152号，2020年3月31日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1173,"end":1212,"target_id":"dccee215f994c232ea29227e8d10432e049986291fd00b1df4bcc3c7e013601f","source_hash":"635e9a308f0ee078eeb1cb21d356a7e8b507048f288b15fe119855b417884f6f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起三个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1212,"end":1330,"target_id":"776629229da5c2abdb0b61b4104b54b5285fd64fcb0e3973fa3ad141b3d135bc","source_hash":"3d2be5f070b5c87e0a6d8548d6b899714e203f47b4b1fa9ffb98779bf057e0dd","text":"第2条（适用于退款请求的诉讼时效）第1条的修正规定也适用于本法实施时政府持有的存款，但自该条第1款各分款规定的日期起未满五年的存款除外。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1330,"end":1361,"target_id":"882bfac8034bcf2dbd1bd41af47dfc0fbd220b4be48a2ef88b2178817d1ff82a","source_hash":"3480e86a86ef9ad8c919b6a09b870d318b15d3a9f68ecd56d35864dbf3fed08b","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第21065号法案，2025年10月1日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1361,"end":1882,"target_id":"e597b9118766cacda111f954f392595a0a3442140105b816c48fad9d268c3b29","source_hash":"5e8ac6ebc080703d90da77b6da219a55c5f1dfb62aa43590097cb9432c27cf97","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，根据附录第七条修正的法律中，修正在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未届满的法律的条款，自相关法律的生效日期起生效；下列各款修正后的规定，自各款所定日期起生效。\n\n  1.下列各项的修订条款应于2026年1月2日生效。但是，根据附录第7条修订的法律（仅限于与第(a)项和第(b)项修订条款相关的部分），在正文生效日期之前颁布但尚未生效的法律的修订部分，应自各相关法律的生效日期起生效。\n\n    A. 修改第十九条第四款、第二十三条、第二十九条第一款第一项和第三十条的规定\n\n    B. 修改第 12 条第 2 款、第 19 条第 3 款、第 22 条以及第 29 条第 2 款但书的规定（仅限于有关财政经济大臣和财政经济部的部分）\n\n    C. 根据附录第7条修正的法案（仅限于与A款和B款修正条款相关的部分）\n\n  2. 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1882,"end":1899,"target_id":"e04f8735a9218ce6d5eda0db462174010dc612a771a0805bf802feae38974ee2","source_hash":"bc6c318c350b2ff1aac4a31f65fcae9d049d5f2d9358ead70ed1a2e0bc93798c","text":"省略第 2 至 6 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1899,"end":2025,"target_id":"e31764bf4d95b6566cefe9e34e0af85bd63f4eba48ad90bf0e2497cda0cbe898","source_hash":"b22c0c8792e710bf1773c7c25529c6286d406763121e9737f98bdecd208651e3","text":"第七条（其他法律的修正）①至<47> 已省略\n\n  <48> 《政府存款法》部分修订如下。\n\n  第 1 条第 2 款中的“战略财政部条例”应改为“财政经济部条例”。\n\n  <49> 至 <626> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000728-276145-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2025,"end":2031,"target_id":"8b4fb049a415c748cd193d990d2d0be79f9b429f7ada2ecef34e7dbe515270c2","source_hash":"ce9e83eae4c8866b9806b56fe62a5bee313e7744a910c2dc81b0d251c1d9c745","text":"第8条省略"}]}